  "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/c4053a6f379f10f145.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"סמלי השבטים\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"213\" data-original-width=\"306\" src=\"/assets/images/content/c4053a6f379f10f145.jpg\" /></a></div></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">סמלים אלטרנטיביים</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>כידוע, לכל שבט נקבע סמל משלו - אריה ליהודה, נחש לדן וכו'.<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אבל, בתמונה שבראש הפוסט הוצגו סמלים אלטרנטיביים, כדלהלן:</span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אוזן - יהודה<br />אריה - דן<br />שור - יוסף<br />ים - נפתלי<br />זרוע - גד<br />יציאה - זבולון<br />חי - ראובן<br />כתפיות - בנימין<br />שמן - אשר<br />אהל - יששכר<br />עין עצומה - לוי</span></span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מצאו את ההקשרים - המבוססים על האמור בפרשת השבוע.</span></span></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מפת דרכים</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>רחוב 'הר נבו', נמצא בערים הבאות:&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>תל אביב, הרצליה, רמת השרון, גני תקוה וכפר סבא.</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">עיינו במפות שלהלן, והסבירו,&nbsp;מדוע מפת <b>הר נבו תל אביב</b>, קשורה לפרשה יותר מהשאר?<br />רמז - הסתמכו על הרחובות הסמוכים.</span></span></span></p><div><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/8b15c4e59efad339ae.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"390\" data-original-width=\"288\" height=\"400\" src=\"/assets/images/content/8b15c4e59efad339ae.png\" width=\"295\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר נבו - תל אביב</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/c223820c8abddd938b.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"471\" data-original-width=\"313\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/c223820c8abddd938b.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר נבו - הרצליה</span></td></tr></tbody></table></span></div><div><span><br /><br /><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/1bc367fd635d2e7eaf.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"456\" data-original-width=\"368\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/1bc367fd635d2e7eaf.png\" width=\"161\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר נבו - רמת השרון</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-large;\"><br /></span></span></div><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/05dca380596cd517ee.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"432\" data-original-width=\"342\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/05dca380596cd517ee.png\" width=\"158\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר נבו - גני תקוה</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><br /><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/dc4d5b9a5225c79c28.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"425\" data-original-width=\"313\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/dc4d5b9a5225c79c28.png\" width=\"148\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר נבו - כפר סבא</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מתנה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 זֶמֶר<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 פרי שנופל מהעץ בטלטול קל<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כינוי לעם ישראל (מהפרשה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חבל ארץ בישראל<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 זיקוק אש<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קריאת זרוז</span></p></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">סמלים אלטרנטיביים</span></span></span></h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אוזן - יהודה - \"שמע ה' קול יהודה\"<br />אריה - דן - \"דן גור אריה\"<br />שור - יוסף - \"בכור שורו הדר לו\"<br />ים - נפתלי - \"ים ודרום ירשה\"<br />זרוע - גד - \"וטרף זרוע אף קודקוד\"<br />יציאה - זבולון - \"שמח זבולון בצאתך\"<br />חי - ראובן - \"יחי ראובן ואל ימות\"<br />כתפיות - בנימין - \"ובין כתפיו שכן\"<br />שמן - אשר - \"וטובל בשמן רגלו\"<br />אהל - יששכר - \"ויששכר באהליך\"<br />עין עצומה - לוי -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">\"האומר לאביו ולאמו לא ראיתיו\"</span></p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מפת דרכים</span></span></h3></span></span></span><p></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בסמוך לרחוב הר נבו בתל אביב, נמצאים הרחובות גלעד ויריחו.<br />אלו מוזכרים עמו בפסוק: \"</span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-style: inherit; text-align: -webkit-center; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">וַיַּעַל מֹשֶׁה מֵעַרְבֹת מוֹאָב אֶל <b>הַר נְבוֹ</b> רֹאשׁ הַפִּסְגָּה אֲשֶׁר עַל פְּנֵי <b>יְרֵחוֹ</b> וַיַּרְאֵהוּ ה' אֶת כָּל הָאָרֶץ אֶת הַ<b>גִּלְעָד</b> עַד דָּן\"</span></span></p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-style: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit;\">שי, שיר</span><span style=\"font-style: inherit;\">, נשיר, ישרון, שרון, נור, נו</span></span></p></span></span></span></div>"
}
